    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Stunning 4 bedroom semi-detached house conveniently located in this sought after area of Donacarney, Co. Meath. No. 9 The Lawn has been finished to an immaculate standard and is well laid out with an abundance of natural light flowing through the home, due to its sunny west facing rear orientation. Boasting a wonderful location close to a range of amenities this property also includes a generously sized rear garden with full privacy & paved patio seating area, perfect for entertaining. Local transport to both Drogheda Town Centre and Dublin City Centre can be found within a 5 minute walk from the entrance to this residential development, whilst Laytown Train Station is within a 5 minute drive. For the motorist, access to the M1 Motorway is within a 10 minute drive. Viewing is highly advised."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nGuest WC\t\t(1.62m x 1.50m) \r\nLiving Room\t\t(4.15m x 4.00m) \r\nKitchen\t\t(3.43m x 2.85m) \r\nLounge / Dining\t(5.07m x 3.46m)\r\nUtility Room\t\t(1.62m x 2.55m)\r\n\r\n1st Floor \r\nLanding \r\nBedroom 1 \t\t(3.63m x 4.11m) \r\nEn Suite\t\t(1.16m x 2.82m) \r\nBedroom 2 \t\t(2.71m x 3.74m) \r\nBedroom 3\t\t(3.59m x 2.78m) \r\nBedroom 4\t\t(2.70m x 2.91m) \r\nMain Bathroom\t(2.02m x 2.10m)"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4 Bedroom Semi-Detached House\r\n* Potential to Convert Large Attic Space\r\nOpen Plan Roof Trusses in Place\r\nBuilt C. 2019\r\nExtends to C. 130 sq.m. \r\nWood & Tiled Ground Floor \r\nWall Panelling\r\nBespoke Italian Pedini Kitchen  \r\nBosch & NEFF Appliances\r\nG-F-C-H – High Efficiency Boiler System\r\nSolar PV Panels \r\nFull Zone Heating Controls\r\nUPVC Double Glazing Throughout\r\nMains Water Softener\r\nHigh Pressure Showers\r\nStira Staircase to Partially Floored Attic Storage\r\nSunny West Facing Rear Orientation\r\nLandscaped Garden & Paved Patio Seating Area\r\nExternal Electric Sockets Front & Rear\r\nRaised Planter Bed \r\nOff-Street Parking – Cobble Driveway\r\nFilly Alarmed"
      },
